{
	"name": "LiveConnect 10 — AI Chatbot with Switch and Per-Intent Replies",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## AI chatbot that routes by intent\n\n**Flow:** Callback Trigger → AI Agent (GPT) that classifies and drafts a reply → Switch by intent → a different response on each branch.\n\n**Configure:**\n1. **OpenAI** (model) and **LiveConnect API** (response nodes) credentials.\n2. Activate the workflow and paste its production URL into the callback of your Flowbot (same `secret` on both sides).\n3. In **Talk to an Advisor** choose your team in `Team Name or ID` (the dropdown loads it from your account).\n\n**How it decides:** the AI Agent returns JSON `{ intencion, message }` thanks to the Structured Output Parser. The Switch routes by `intencion` and each branch builds its own actions.\n\n**Golden rule:** the branches that keep the conversation going close with `input` (the node adds it on its own). The branch that delegates to a human does NOT carry `input`: the bot deliberately exits the callback.",
				"height": 460,
				"width": 520
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
			"name": "Instructions",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-40,
				-320
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"secret": "change-this-secret",
				"responseMode": "responseNode",
				"simple": true,
				"path": "callback-switch"
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
			"name": "LiveConnect Callback Trigger",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-liveconnect.liveConnectCallbackTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				180,
				200
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"promptType": "define",
				"text": "={{ $json.message }}",
				"hasOutputParser": true,
				"options": {
					"systemMessage": "You are the company's virtual assistant and you handle WhatsApp support in English, with brief and friendly responses.\n\nThe customer's name is {{ $json.contact.nombre || 'customer' }}. {{ $json.isFirstTurn ? 'This is their first message: greet them.' : '' }}\n\nClassify their message into ONE of these intents and draft the appropriate reply:\n- \"ventas\": asks about products, plans, or wants to buy.\n- \"soporte\": has a problem, a complaint, or asks to talk to a person.\n- \"agenda\": wants to schedule, reschedule, or check an appointment.\n- \"otro\": greetings, thanks, or anything that does not fit above.\n\nReturn ONLY the requested JSON. In \"message\" write what will be sent to the customer (maximum 3 sentences, no markdown). If the intent is \"soporte\", the message must let them know you are transferring them to a person on the team."
				}
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
			"name": "Classify and Draft Reply",
			"type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
			"typeVersion": 1.9,
			"position": [
				460,
				180
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"model": {
					"__rl": true,
					"value": "gpt-4o-mini",
					"mode": "list",
					"cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
			"name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
			"type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
			"typeVersion": 1.2,
			"position": [
				340,
				420
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"sessionIdType": "customKey",
				"sessionKey": "={{ $('LiveConnect Callback Trigger').first().json.sessionId }}"
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
			"name": "Conversation Memory",
			"type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
			"typeVersion": 1.3,
			"position": [
				500,
				420
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"schemaType": "fromJson",
				"jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"intencion\": \"ventas\",\n  \"message\": \"I would be happy to help you with the available plans.\"\n}"
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
			"name": "Output Format",
			"type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
			"typeVersion": 1.2,
			"position": [
				660,
				420
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"rules": {
					"values": [
						{
							"conditions": {
								"options": {
									"caseSensitive": false,
									"leftValue": "",
									"typeValidation": "loose",
									"version": 2
								},
								"conditions": [
									{
										"leftValue": "={{ $json.output.intencion }}",
										"rightValue": "ventas",
										"operator": {
											"type": "string",
											"operation": "equals"
										}
									}
								],
								"combinator": "and"
							},
							"renameOutput": true,
							"outputKey": "Ventas"
						},
						{
							"conditions": {
								"options": {
									"caseSensitive": false,
									"leftValue": "",
									"typeValidation": "loose",
									"version": 2
								},
								"conditions": [
									{
										"leftValue": "={{ $json.output.intencion }}",
										"rightValue": "soporte",
										"operator": {
											"type": "string",
											"operation": "equals"
										}
									}
								],
								"combinator": "and"
							},
							"renameOutput": true,
							"outputKey": "Soporte"
						},
						{
							"conditions": {
								"options": {
									"caseSensitive": false,
									"leftValue": "",
									"typeValidation": "loose",
									"version": 2
								},
								"conditions": [
									{
										"leftValue": "={{ $json.output.intencion }}",
										"rightValue": "agenda",
										"operator": {
											"type": "string",
											"operation": "equals"
										}
									}
								],
								"combinator": "and"
							},
							"renameOutput": true,
							"outputKey": "Agenda"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {
					"fallbackOutput": "extra",
					"renameFallbackOutput": "Otro"
				}
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
			"name": "Route by Intent",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
			"typeVersion": 3.2,
			"position": [
				820,
				180
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "callbackResponse",
				"operation": "send",
				"acciones": {
					"accion": [
						{
							"tipo": "sendText",
							"text": "={{ $json.output.message }}"
						},
						{
							"tipo": "addVar",
							"varname": "intencion",
							"varvalue": "ventas"
						}
					]
				},
				"autoInput": true,
				"respondWebhook": true
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
			"name": "Sales Reply",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-liveconnect.liveConnect",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				1120,
				-40
			]
		},
		{
