			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
			"name": "General Reply",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-liveconnect.liveConnect",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				1120,
				500
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "### Each branch builds its own actions\n\n- **Sales / General / Schedule**: send the AI's text and close with `input` to keep the conversation going (Schedule also asks for the day).\n- **Talk to an Advisor**: `teamDelegate` hands the conversation off to a human. The node removes the `input` automatically because the bot must exit the callback.\n\nEach node responds to the webhook itself: no Respond to Webhook node is needed.",
				"height": 300,
				"width": 380
			},
			"id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
			"name": "Branch Notes",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
